OL,3,GNEWSAMain Douglas to Peel road to close
OL,4,Afor tree works
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the main road between Douglas
OL,7,Fand Peel will be closed on Sunday while
OL,8,Ftree works take place.
OL,10,FThe A1 Peel Road will shut between
OL,11,FBraddan Church and the Rural Industries
OL,12,Festate at Union Mills from 08:00 to
OL,13,F17:00 GMT on 1 November.
OL,15,FDrivers will be diverted via Saddle
OL,16,FRoad, Vicarage Road and the Isle of Man
OL,17,FBusiness Park.
OL,19,FThe closure is due to tree surgery work
OL,20,Fbeing done on behalf of a private
OL,21,Flandowner.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
